diversified long short portfolio.

170
00:26:46,860 --> 00:26:55,860
And if you don't take this approach, then
all you're doing is you're not maximizing
your opportunities and you're not taking
the professional trading approach.

171
00:26:55,860 --> 00:27:02,860
So if you're just a day trader all the
time, you're trying to dictate to the
market what you can and can't do.

172
00:27:03,860 --> 00:27:10,860
Whereas professional traders actually do
the opposite and just let the market tell
them what they can and can't do.

173
00:27:10,860 --> 00:27:13,860
And this is the classic retail trader
mistake.

174
00:27:13,860 --> 00:27:19,860
So all of this stuff you've seen at the
