available.

181
00:28:08,860 --> 00:28:11,860
So no appreciation for those general
opportunities that are available.

182
00:28:12,860 --> 00:28:15,860
So people don't really focus on market
conditions.

183
00:28:16,860 --> 00:28:18,860
The second thing is a lack of preparation.

184
00:28:19,860 --> 00:28:22,860
So there's no similar to portfolio
management.

185
00:28:22,860 --> 00:28:32,860
There's never really systematic processes
