really affect the asset that you think
it's going to affect.

191
00:29:07,860 --> 00:29:08,860
And only using technical indicators.

192
00:29:08,860 --> 00:29:21,860
So most retail traders that day trade
really just trade on newspaper articles,
TV headlines and old news, however it's
delivered to them.

193
00:29:22,860 --> 00:29:28,860
And most because it's easy to understand
