quickly again.

385
00:53:38,860 --> 00:53:43,860
Make sure you read over the day trading
best practices guide.

386
00:53:43,860 --> 00:53:49,860
This will give you a good focus on whether
you should actually be taking a position
or not.

387
00:53:49,860 --> 00:53:53,860
And how you outline your plan to do so.

388
00:53:53,860 --> 00:53:55,860
Then move on to this.

389
00:53:55,860 --> 00:53:58,860
Once you've actually decided, I'm going to
take a position now.

390
00:53:58,860 --> 00:54:02,860
Then you should be moving on to looking at
