392
00:54:12,860 --> 00:54:19,860
So we're looking at just about a year of
data.

393
00:54:19,860 --> 00:54:25,860
And we're looking at an average share
value over the period.

394
00:54:25,860 --> 00:54:29,860
We're looking at the average range, high
to low.

395
00:54:29,860 --> 00:54:32,860
So this is the ATR.

396
00:54:32,860 --> 00:54:40,860
We're looking at the average open to high
