416
00:57:16,860 --> 00:57:19,860
Am I doing a bum trade?

417
00:57:19,860 --> 00:57:23,860
Should I be deploying capital to this
situation?

418
00:57:23,860 --> 00:57:32,860
It's obviously up to you as the
