421
00:57:45,860 --> 00:57:46,860
There isn't.

422
00:57:46,860 --> 00:57:47,860
There isn't.

423
00:57:47,860 --> 00:57:52,860
So you just have to look at the odds here
and make a decision and use common sense.

424
00:57:52,860 --> 00:58:08,860
So with an average open to high move of
5.1 pence from the open, if you buy this
stock above 5 pence from the open, your
odds of making money are actually very,
very thin.

425
00:58:08,860 --> 00:58:30,860
So manage your expectations and make sure
that A, you either don't do it or B, if
you're going to trade in Barclays and you
get the situation at a good price and the
risk reward is there to set a sensible
stop loss and sensible target, then you
can actually go ahead and deploy capital.

426
00:58:30,860 --> 00:58:31,860
So what about on the downside?

427
00:58:31,860 --> 00:58:39,860
Well, it's pretty obvious there that on
