opportunities to day trade Barclays.

428
00:58:39,860 --> 00:58:40,860
You might want to move on.

429
00:58:40,860 --> 00:58:43,860
You might want to look at something else.

430
00:58:43,860 --> 00:58:47,860
The average open to low move is 4.9 pence.

431
00:58:47,860 --> 00:59:00,860
If there's materially negative news out in
Barclays and you think you're going to go
into the market and short it on the open
and make 50p, there's something wrong with
