432
00:59:00,860 --> 00:59:02,860
You've obviously not done your homework.

433
00:59:02,860 --> 00:59:05,860
You've not pulled up the historical
volatility.

434
00:59:05,860 --> 00:59:19,860
You need to check this and manage your
expectations, get in at a price that makes
sense and set stop losses and targets
accordingly.

435
00:59:19,860 --> 00:59:31,860
And we've got some repeated analysis here
for stocks in the FTSE 100 and for the
FTSE 100 itself.

436
00:59:31,860 --> 00:59:33,860
So you can go through those in your own
