437
00:59:33,860 --> 00:59:36,860
But that ATR exercise, very, very
important.

438
00:59:36,860 --> 00:59:38,860
Make sure you do that.

439
00:59:38,860 --> 00:59:42,860
Make sure you do that before you ever put
on a day trade.

440
00:59:42,860 --> 00:59:50,860
It's a variance of the ATR, but usually
within day trading, you're going to be
deciding before the open which way you're
